sequenceDiagram
actor Admin
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Service as "shelfLifeDiscountService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Admin->>UI: Configure Category/SKU HSD discount band
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/shelf-life-discounts
API->>Service: validateRule(scope, band, type, value)
Service->>DB: Check overlap, precedence and historical versions
alt Valid version
    Service->>DB: Save versioned percentage/fixed rule and audit
    DB-->>API: Rule version
    API-->>-UI: Rule published
else Invalid overlap or scope
    API-->>UI: Validation error
end

